            <div class="container">
               <section class="page-intro">
                  <p>Welcome to Lawson State Community College Cougars Baseball!</p>
                  
                  <p>Our NJCAA baseball program is a source of Cougar Pride and a key part of our athletic
                     tradition. Competing in the highly competitive Alabama Community College Conference
                     (ACCC), our student-athletes embody excellence, persistence, and dedication on and
                     off the baseball diamond.</p>
                  
                  <p>Come support the Cougars at every home game played at Roy W. Johnson Field on our
                     Birmingham campus.</p>
                  
                  <p><a style="color: #090e37;" href="https://www.acccathletics.com/sports/bsb/2025-26/schedule?teamId=eo2ipfapxlhv9jzz">Visit ACCC site for the Schedule.</a></p>
               </section>
